---
import SoftBoundary from '../SoftBoundary.astro';
import WomenWhyText from '../WomenWhyText.astro';
import '../../styles/women-system.css';
import {womensHealthEn as c} from '../../data/womens-health-en';
import {url} from '../../data/site';
---
<div class="womens-health-page">
<section class="section feminine-hero"><div><h1>{c.title}</h1><p class="feminine-statement">{c.statement}</p><p>{c.intro}</p><a class="button" href="#approche-sante-feminine">Discover my approach</a></div><div class="feminine-hero-photo"><img src="/images/softness-1200.webp" srcset="/images/softness-640.webp 640w, /images/softness-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 45vw" width="1200" height="800" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="Lauriane by the sea, her hands near her face in the sunset light"/><svg class="feminine-hero-orbit" viewBox="0 0 600 120" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M250 50C332 4 431 118 555 58" stroke="#FF6230" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div></section>
<section class="section feminine-why" id="approche-sante-feminine"><div class="feminine-editorial"><h2>Why Women’s Health?</h2><div><WomenWhyText paragraphs={c.why}/></div></div><p class="feminine-pull feminine-why-statement"><span>Understanding your rhythms</span> also means understanding your body and everything that comes with it.</p></section>
<SoftBoundary from="#FFFDF7" to="#F8BCCA" intensity="network-in"/>
<section class="section feminine-cycle"><svg class="feminine-cycle-trajectory" viewBox="0 0 1440 500" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M-70 392C137 485 330 373 505 412C641 451 801 482 1005 433C1274 379 1520 405 1472 205" stroke="#FF6230" stroke-width="30" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M1506 86C1517 213 1494 325 1408 370" stroke="#5E1AF4" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><div class="feminine-cycle-composition"><h2>Reconnect <span class="keep-together">with your cycle</span></h2><p class="feminine-pull">{c.nonlinear}</p><div class="feminine-cycle-reading">{c.cycle.map(p=><p>{p}</p>)}</div></div></section>
<SoftBoundary from="#F8BCCA" to="#FFFDF7" intensity="network-out"/>
<section class="section feminine-topics"><h2>Topics I’m deepening<span class="feminine-dot" aria-hidden="true">.</span></h2><p>{c.topicsIntro}</p><ul class="feminine-topic-grid">{c.topics.map(topic=><li id={`sujet-${topic.key}`}>{topic.title}</li>)}</ul></section>
<section class="section feminine-development"><div class="feminine-editorial"><h2>A specialisation in development</h2><div><p>{c.development[0]}</p><p>It is also enriching the way I practise <a class="feminine-inline-link" href={url('en','acupuncture')}>traditional acupuncture</a> and how I look at the links between the cycle, the body and what each woman is going through.</p><p class="feminine-evolution-note">{c.next}</p></div></div></section>
<section class="final-cta section"><svg class="feminine-closing-orbit" viewBox="0 0 500 500" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M-91 25C198 -68 389 126 271 302C215 384 71 304 30 439" stroke="#FF6230" stroke-width="18" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h2>Continue with acupuncture<span class="feminine-dot">.</span></h2><p class="feminine-final-support">Want to explore your cycle or what you’re going through through the lens of traditional acupuncture? Discover my approach.</p><a class="button" href={url('en','acupuncture')}>Explore Traditional Acupuncture</a></section>
</div>
